型。アトミックモンキー所属。\r\n\r\nアトミックモンキー声優・演技研究所第5期卒業生。趣味・特技はカラオケ、ものまね。","career":["seiyu"],"id":33487,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":225326},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/b2/c2/225327_crt_CSs5T.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/b2/c2/225327_crt_CSs5T.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/b2/c2/225327_crt_CSs5T.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/b2/c2/225327_crt_CSs5T.jpg"},"name":"盗賊の頭","summary":"","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/41/d5/44989_prsn_HvyaY.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/41/d5/44989_prsn_HvyaY.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/41/d5/44989_prsn_HvyaY.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/41/d5/44989_prsn_HvyaY.jpg"},"name":"山口恵","short_summary":"","career":["seiyu","actor"],"id":44989,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":225327},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/19/72/225328_crt_4rT4o.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/19/72/225328_crt_4rT4o.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/19/72/225328_crt_4rT4o.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/19/72/225328_crt_4rT4o.jpg"},"name":"医師","summary":"","relation":"闲角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/11/74/5137_prsn_IT72c.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/11/74/5137_prsn_IT72c.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/11/74/5137_prsn_IT72c.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/11/74/5137_prsn_IT72c.jpg"},"name":"高橋伸也","short_summary":"高橋 伸也（たかはし しんや、1978年12月5日 - ）は、日本の男性声優、ナレーター、司会者。ラクーンドッグ所属。山形県酒田市出身。身長165cm、血液型はB型。\r\n\r\n『喰霊-零-』の飯綱紀之役がアニメ初レギュラーで、『「喰霊-零-」超自然災害ラジオ対策室』第18回がラジオ初出演。なお、本ラジオに声優でゲスト出演したのは高橋が初めてである。\r\n2015年4月、アニメ『暗殺教室』の打ち上げにて結婚したことを発表。同席していた緒方恵美が本人の許可のもとTwitterで「おめでとう」と祝福し、一般公表された。","career":["seiyu"],"id":5137,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":225328},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/96/73/226239_crt_2WoR7.jpg","grid":"https:/